WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:02.002
Emily:
Is that you?

00:00:03.045 --> 00:00:04.046
He-hey! 

00:00:04.213 --> 00:00:05.130
Hey.

00:00:06.423 --> 00:00:08.217
Hey, I'm really happy you're
here.

00:00:08.842 --> 00:00:09.510
Emily:
Why is that?

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:11.678
Because I like you...a lot.

00:00:13.222 --> 00:00:14.473
You wanna go for a walk?

00:00:14.473 --> 00:00:16.975
♪♪

00:00:16.975 --> 00:00:17.976
Tom Holland:
You meet Cherry,

00:00:17.976 --> 00:00:19.686
Tom Holland:
and he's a kid who's having a
hard time.

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:22.898
He just doesn't really know why
he feels the way he feels.

00:00:22.898 --> 00:00:25.025
And he meets this wonderful
lady called Emily.

00:00:25.776 --> 00:00:30.030
Cherry is the first time Emily
has ever experienced love. 

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:32.324
It's just pheromones playing
tricks on people.

00:00:32.324 --> 00:00:33.408
I love you.

00:00:33.408 --> 00:00:36.036
Ciara Bravo:
She's finally escaped an abusive
home.

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:39.039
Ciara Bravo:
It forces her to face her
demons.

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:41.667
In a way that causes her to
self-destruct.

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:43.752
♪♪

00:00:43.752 --> 00:00:45.504
Emily:
I'm leaving for good at
the end of the semester.

00:00:45.504 --> 00:00:46.588
Please tell me that you're
kidding.

00:00:46.588 --> 00:00:47.589
This isn't funny.

00:00:48.048 --> 00:00:49.049
Emily:
Why would I be kidding you? 

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:50.050
♪♪

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:51.051
(Door slams)

00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:53.053
(Road noise)

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:54.054
Recruiter:
She broke your heart?

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:56.139
(Bang)
I like him.

00:00:56.139 --> 00:00:59.685
♪♪

00:00:59.685 --> 00:01:01.103
Platoon in unison:
Yes, Drill Sergeant!

00:01:01.103 --> 00:01:02.104
♪♪

00:01:02.104 --> 00:01:05.148
She is the one that leaves him
and he goes into this spiral.

00:01:05.148 --> 00:01:06.483
Tom Holland:
And he joins the military.

00:01:06.483 --> 00:01:15.117
♪♪

00:01:15.117 --> 00:01:16.118
(Glass shatters)

00:01:16.118 --> 00:01:18.537
(Crowd cheering)

00:01:18.537 --> 00:01:20.289
Tom Holland:
When they come back together,

00:01:20.289 --> 00:01:22.040
Tom Holland:
they don't come back together
for the right reasons.

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:24.042
Ciara Bravo:
When he comes back from Iraq,

00:01:24.042 --> 00:01:25.085
♪♪

00:01:25.085 --> 00:01:27.587
Tom and I completely destroy our
character's lives.

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:28.588
(Ticking)

00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:29.798
(Gunshots)
Get on the ground!

00:01:29.798 --> 00:01:31.383
♪♪

00:01:31.383 --> 00:01:33.093
Tom Holland:
He doesn't really know what
to do without her.

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:35.512
And he doesn't really know how
to live life with her.

00:01:35.512 --> 00:01:36.680
♪♪

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:40.517
We don't shy away from the
negative aspects of this type of
love.

00:01:40.517 --> 00:01:52.696
♪♪

